></p><ul><li><p><strong>Latest AZ-104 exam prep content (2026):</strong> Th=
is course contains practice questions based on the latest Microsoft Azure A=
dministrator exam objectives and syllabus. All questions are aligned with t=
opics measured in the official AZ-104 exam guide, ensuring you practice rel=
evant and up-to-date concepts expected in the certification exam.<br></p></=
li><li><p><strong>Detailed Reasoning for answers</strong>:&nbsp;I&nbsp;have=
